        "detail": "Your link tops out around 1050 MB/s (USB 3.2 Gen2 SuperSpeed+ (10 Gbps)). The advertised 2100 MB/s needs a 20 Gbps (USB 3.2 Gen2x2 / USB4) connection. Even a flawless drive cannot exceed the connection, so this shortfall is the port/cable/host — not the flash.",
